<title>UK: Kredietbank  unit sets 50 mln Ecu structured bond.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank  unit sets 50 mln Ecu structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead  manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KB INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDIETBANK NV</p>
<p> AMT    50 MLN ECU    COUPON     ***	 MATURITY    30.NOV.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.576   PAY DATE  L-30.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    LONDON    SPREAD	15 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA-   DENOMS (K) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC   1.375</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED APRIL 2005 AND APRIL 2006 OAT</p>
<p> NOTES    ***PAYS A ZERO COUPON ON 30.NOV.99 THEN COUPON STEPS-</p>
<p>		 UP TO 12.0 PCT, THEREAFTER COUPON ALTERNATES</p>
<p>BETWEEN</p>
<p>		 ZERO AND 12.0 PCT YEARLY.</p>
<p>		 L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		 ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		 UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
